      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天终于忙完了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "是啊，下午比我想的还忙。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "还好最后都做完了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "你晚上有什么计划？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "本来想回家做饭，不过现在有点儿累。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那就做简单一点儿的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "可能煮面，再加一点儿蔬菜。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "听起来不错。吃完以后呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我想看一会儿中文视频，然后早点儿睡。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "你每天都学习中文吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "大部分时间会学一点儿，但是不会太久。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "这样挺好，不容易累。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我发现每天二十分钟比周末学两个小时更适合我。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "重要的是能坚持。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对。工作忙的时候，我就少学一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "休息也很重要，别把每天都安排得太满。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我会注意。喝完茶我就回家。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc007_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "好，明天见。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
